---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import {owners,number} from '../lib/snapshot.mjs';
const rows=owners();
---
<Page title="Documented owners"><h1>Documented owners</h1>
<p class="intro">Residents inside the combined footprints of roster stations with a documented parent. Where stations overlap, residents count once. These figures cover linked roster entries, not every transmitter an organization might operate.</p>
{rows.length ? <div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Owner</th><th>Roster stations</th><th class="num">2020 resident reach</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{rows.map(r=><tr><th scope="row"><a href={`/owners/${r.id}/`}>{r.name}</a></th><td>{r.members}</td><td class="num">{number(r.residents)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div> : <p>No verified owner groups are available in this snapshot.</p>}
<p class="note">A network affiliation or a shared format is not evidence of ownership. Unresolved stations remain in the <a href="/">directory</a>.</p></Page>
